sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as the orchestrator
    participant T as the ticket file<br/>in the agent repo
    participant A as the agent repo's<br/>ticket branch
    participant W as the worker
    O->>T: status: claimed
    O->>W: the ticket's context, and both repos on its ticket branch
    W->>A: its show directory: the demo, the figures, report.md
    Note over A,W: the committed report is the finished signal
    W-->>O: exits
    A-->>O: dispatch fetch brings the branch, the report on it
    O->>T: dispatch review imports it: the comment,<br/>the questions, status: review
    Note over O,T: `tracker rule` answers a question here, before the merge
